+  refuted: read path aliases from the root tsconfig.json only, as the rule first did -> "coherence/chokepoint under oxlint: an import or a re-export outside the chokepoint goes red, a test is exempt, and removing the bypass goes green" went red in lint.test.ts; restored, green; made the rule pass over an import-equals require -> the same test went red; restored, green; stopped reading the configured test folders, so only a .test or .spec name exempts a file -> the same test went red; restored, green (2026-09-30)
