+- the lint rule never drops a bullet in silence: A spec the coherence/chokepoint rule cannot read, a module-form bullet whose protected module or chokepoint it cannot resolve, and a configuration it cannot find or parse at its root are each reported at line 1 of every linted file under the component, and the lint goes on.
